# Schindler et al. (2023, ApJ 943, 67), Table 3 ("The binned PS1 distant quasar survey QLF"), corrected Phi column; checked against arXiv:2212.04179v2
# Sample: 121 quasars of the Pan-STARRS1 distant quasar survey (PS1 only; the SHELLQs points in their Fig. are not tabulated)
# Redshift: 5.7 <= z <= 6.2 (text: 5.65 <~ z <~ 6.25); median z ~ 5.85
# Magnitude definition: M1450 bin centres (0.5-mag bins; the faintest bin is -25.38 +- 0.38). The median M1450 per bin
#       (-27.32, -27.06, -26.44, -25.98, -25.52) is not used.
# Phi convention: linear Phi in units of 1e-9 cMpc^-3 mag^-1 (table in Gpc^-3 mag^-1); H0 = 70, Om = 0.3, OL = 0.7
# Note: Phi includes the completeness correction (the table's uncorrected column is not used). Errors are Gehrels-type 1-sigma
#       Poisson deltas (upper, lower).
#
# M1450  Phi  UpperDelta  LowerDelta
 -27.500  0.149  0.089  0.059
 -27.000  0.381  0.126  0.097
 -26.500  0.843  0.180  0.151
 -26.000  1.700  0.328  0.278
 -25.380  3.433  0.721  0.604
